From 8701ce6ecba371cb623bbc78f813c4fdabb4ebac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Usty <usty@uase.tech>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 09:41:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] chore: bump iOS version 1.0.3 (2) -> 1.0.4 (3) for the
 black-screen fix build

Bumped MARKETING_VERSION and CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION consistently in
both the Debug and Release build configurations, so this doesn't
reintroduce the exact Debug/Release version mismatch already fixed
earlier in this project's history.

Before bumping, did a full sweep for other plausible black-screen
causes beyond the ATS fix already committed, to make sure nothing
else was still silently broken:
- WKAppBoundDomains: not present, ruled out
- Native Swift files (AppDelegate.swift, ViewController.swift):
  standard boilerplate plus one intentional back-gesture addition,
  nothing that could block or interfere with loading
- Content-Security-Policy: none configured in next.config.js, ruled
  out as a WKWebView-specific blocker
- Service worker (public/sw.js): already correctly skips
  navigation/document requests entirely, so it cannot serve stale
  cached HTML after an update - already fixed in this project's
  history for a related but distinct white-screen-on-refresh bug,
  verified still correct
- capacitor.config.json / config.xml: confirmed properly gitignored
  (ios/.gitignore), so there's no stale committed copy that could
  undermine the CI script's fresh generation of these files on every
  build
- Package.resolved: confirmed present, valid JSON, matches the fix
  already documented in ci_post_clone.sh

Nothing else found. The ATS fix (previous commit) remains the one
concrete, verified gap for an iOS-only black screen on this kind of
remotely-loaded app.
---
 ios/App/App.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ios/App/App.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj b/ios/App/App.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj
index 668e464..b158d40 100644
--- a/ios/App/App.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj
+++ b/ios/App/App.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj
@@ -301,14 +301,14 @@
 				ASSETCATALOG_COMPILER_APPICON_NAME = AppIcon;
 				CODE_SIGN_ENTITLEMENTS = App/App.entitlements;
 				CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Automatic;
-				CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION = 2;
+				CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION = 3;
 				INFOPLIST_FILE = App/Info.plist;
 				IPHONEOS_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET = 15.0;
 				LD_RUNPATH_SEARCH_PATHS = (
 					"$(inherited)",
 					"@executable_path/Frameworks",
 				);
-				MARKETING_VERSION = 1.0.3;
+				MARKETING_VERSION = 1.0.4;
 				OTHER_SWIFT_FLAGS = "$(inherited) \"-D\" \"COCOAPODS\" \"-DDEBUG\"";
 				PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER = com.uasetechstudio.carstrims;
 				PRODUCT_NAME = "$(TARGET_NAME)";
@@ -324,14 +324,14 @@
 				ASSETCATALOG_COMPILER_APPICON_NAME = AppIcon;
 				CODE_SIGN_ENTITLEMENTS = App/App.entitlements;
